### RocketMQ Version

develop @ `57c2dc04f78cc7e73e6b8c9436ee0fff0d0f46c3` (the revision this was verified on)

### Describe the Bug

`RemotingProtocolServer` schedules the expired-request cleanup in its constructor:

```java
this.timerExecutor = ThreadUtils.newSingleThreadScheduledExecutor(
    new ThreadFactoryBuilder().setNameFormat("RemotingServerScheduler-%d").build()
