### Before reporting a bug

- [x] I have searched open and closed [GitHub issues](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/issues).
- [x] I have read the [ShardingSphere documentation](https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/overview).

### ShardingSphere version

master, commit [`01446d4fad4`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/commit/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df)

### ShardingSphere project

ShardingSphere-Proxy

### Expected behavior

The proxy should answer [`op_attach`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/remote/server/server.cpp#L5077-L5079) to a database that does not exist with the error code [`isc_io_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/os/posix/unix.cpp#L687-L688), as the Firebird server does, and not with [`isc_unavailable`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L56).

### Actual behavior

The proxy answers with another error code than the Firebird server.

The same steps were executed directly on the Firebird server and through the proxy, with the database name shown as `[database]` in the messages:

| Steps | Firebird server | Proxy |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Connect ([`op_attach`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/remote/server/server.cpp#L5077-L5079)) to a database that does not exist (through the proxy `firebird_db_nosuch`, directly a database file that does not exist) | Error [`isc_io_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/os/posix/unix.cpp#L687-L688) "I/O error during "open" operation for file "[database]"; Error while trying to open file; No such file or directory" | Error [`isc_unavailable`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L56) "unavailable database; [database]" |

So an application that checks the error code to tell a wrong database name from an unavailable database gets a different answer through the proxy.

### Reason analysis

- [`FirebirdAuthenticationEngine#login`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/proxy/frontend/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/proxy/frontend/firebird/authentication/FirebirdAuthenticationEngine.java#L114-L117) throws [`UnknownDatabaseException`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/exception/core/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/exception/core/exception/syntax/database/UnknownDatabaseException.java#L29) when the database from [`op_attach`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/remote/server/server.cpp#L5077-L5079) is not in the proxy configuration.
