body_text:
### Before reporting a bug

- [x] I have searched open and closed [GitHub issues](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/issues).
- [x] I have read the [ShardingSphere documentation](https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/overview).

### ShardingSphere version

master, commit [`8a10a2f4822`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/commit/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2)

### ShardingSphere project

ShardingSphere-Proxy

### Expected behavior

The proxy should execute statements with these built-in functions and predicates as the Firebird server does.

### Actual behavior

The proxy rejects each of these statements with a syntax error.

The same statements were executed directly on the Firebird server and through the proxy:

| Steps | Firebird server | Proxy |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'EXTRACT(YEAR'" |
| `SELECT DATEADD(1 DAY TO TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEADD(1DAY'" |
| `SELECT DATEADD(DAY, 1, TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEADD(DAY'" |
| `SELECT DATEDIFF(DAY, TS, TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEDIFF(DAY'" |
| `SELECT DATEDIFF(DAY FROM TS TO TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEDIFF(DAY'" |
| `SELECT LEFT(NAME, 2) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'LEFT'" |
| `SELECT RIGHT(NAME, 2) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'RIGHT'" |
| `SELECT POSITION('a', NAME) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'POSITION('a','" |
| `SELECT OVERLAY(NAME PLACING 'x' FROM 1) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'OVERLAY(NAMEPLACING'" |
| `SELECT LIST(DISTINCT NAME) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | One row: NULL | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'LIST(DISTINCT'" |
| `SELECT COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ID > 0) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1` | One row: 0 | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: SELECT COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE ID > 0) FROM T_PLAIN WHERE ID = -1, null" |
| `SELECT 1 FROM RDB$DATABASE WHERE NEXT VALUE FOR S_AUDIT_SEQ > 0` | One row: 1 | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'NEXT'" |
| `SELECT ID FROM T_PLAIN WHERE NAME CONTAINING 'x' AND ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'NAMECONTAINING'" |
| `SELECT ID FROM T_PLAIN WHERE SINGULAR (SELECT 1 FROM RDB$DATABASE) AND ID = -1` | Success, no rows | Error [`isc_dsql_error`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/include/firebird/impl/msg/jrd.h#L250) "Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'SINGULAR(SELECT'" |

So through the proxy an application cannot use these built-in functions and predicates of Firebird.

### Reason analysis

The Firebird grammar of ShardingSphere does not have these forms:

- [`extractFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L333-L335) expects an [`identifier`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L65-L67) for the date part, but the ShardingSphere lexer reads [`YEAR`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L390-L392), [`DAY`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L406-L408) and the other [date parts](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8741-L8757) of [`EXTRACT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8198-L8200), except `MILLISECOND`, `WEEKDAY`, `YEARDAY` and `TIMEZONE_NAME`, as keywords;
- [`specialFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L306-L315) and [`regularFunctionName`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L355-L361) have no [`DATEADD`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8307-L8318) and [`DATEDIFF`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8319-L8330) with a date part, no [`OVERLAY`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8359-L8370), no [`NEXT VALUE FOR`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8726-L8732), and no [`LEFT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8265) and [`RIGHT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8284), which the ShardingSphere lexer reads as [keywords](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L198-L204);
- [`positionFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L325-L327) accepts only `POSITION(a IN b)`, not the form with a comma ([`POSITION`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8376-L8377));
- [`aggregationFunctionName`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L298-L300) has no [`LIST`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7996-L7999), and [`aggregationFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L294-L296) has no [`FILTER`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7946) clause;
- [`predicate`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L246-L255) has no [`CONTAINING`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7111-L7113), and [`simpleExpr`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L273-L288) has no [`SINGULAR`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7171-L7174).

The open PR #39759 adds `LEFT` and `RIGHT` to [`regularFunctionName`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L355-L361). It does not cover the other functions and predicates in the table.

The list covers the functions and predicates that were checked. Other built-in functions and predicates of Firebird may be missing from the grammar too.

### Steps to reproduce

#### Environment

- Firebird server 5.0.
- Client: Jaybird 6.0.7.

#### Steps

1. Create the objects on the Firebird server:

```sql
CREATE TABLE T_PLAIN (ID INTEGER NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY, NAME VARCHAR(20));
CREATE TABLE T_TS (ID INTEGER NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY, TS TIMESTAMP);
CREATE SEQUENCE S_AUDIT_SEQ;
```

2. Start ShardingSphere-Proxy with this configuration:

```yaml
# global.yaml
authority:
  users:
    - user: root@%
      password: root
  privilege:
    type: ALL_PERMITTED
props:
  proxy-frontend-database-protocol-type: Firebird
```

```yaml
# database-firebird.yaml
databaseName: firebird_db
dataSources:
  ds_0:
    url: jdbc:firebirdsql://<host>/<database file>?encoding=UTF8
    username: <user>
    password: <password>
rules:
  - !SINGLE
    tables:
      - "*.*"
```

3. Execute the statements from the table under "Actual behavior" through the proxy and directly on the Firebird server, and compare the results. "Example code" runs all of them.

### Example code

The statements from the table on Jaybird 6.0.7. The comment above each call shows what it prints against the Firebird server and through the proxy.

```java
import java.sql.Connection;
import java.sql.DriverManager;
import java.sql.ResultSet;
import java.sql.ResultSetMetaData;
import java.sql.SQLException;
import java.sql.Statement;
import java.sql.Types;
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;

public class BuiltinExpressionSyntax {

    // The proxy; put the URL, user and password of the Firebird server here to compare
    static final String URL = "jdbc:firebirdsql://<proxy host>:<proxy port>/firebird_db?encoding=UTF8&wireCrypt=DISABLED";

    static final String USER = "root";

    static final String PASSWORD = "root";

    public static void main(final String[] args) throws SQLException {
        try (Connection connection = DriverManager.getConnection(URL, USER, PASSWORD)) {
            // Firebird server: "SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> EXTRACT SMALLINT: no rows";
            // proxy: "SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> error: Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'EXTRACT(YEAR' [SQLState:42000, ISC error code:335544569]"
            execute(connection, "SELECT EXTRACT(YEAR FROM TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1");
            // Firebird server: "SELECT DATEADD(1 DAY TO TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> DATEADD TIMESTAMP: no rows";
            // proxy: "SELECT DATEADD(1 DAY TO TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> error: Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEADD(1DAY' [SQLState:42000, ISC error code:335544569]"
            execute(connection, "SELECT DATEADD(1 DAY TO TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1");
            // Firebird server: "SELECT DATEADD(DAY, 1, TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> DATEADD TIMESTAMP: no rows";
            // proxy: "SELECT DATEADD(DAY, 1, TS) FROM T_TS WHERE ID = -1 -> error: Dynamic SQL Error; You have an error in your SQL syntax: no viable alternative at input 'DATEADD(DAY' [SQLState:42000, ISC error code:335544569]"
