### Reason analysis

The Firebird grammar of ShardingSphere does not have these forms:

- [`extractFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L333-L335) expects an [`identifier`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L65-L67) for the date part, but the ShardingSphere lexer reads [`YEAR`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L390-L392), [`DAY`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L406-L408) and the other [date parts](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8741-L8757) of [`EXTRACT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8198-L8200), except `MILLISECOND`, `WEEKDAY`, `YEARDAY` and `TIMEZONE_NAME`, as keywords;
- [`specialFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L306-L315) and [`regularFunctionName`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L355-L361) have no [`DATEADD`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8307-L8318) and [`DATEDIFF`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8319-L8330) with a date part, no [`OVERLAY`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8359-L8370), no [`NEXT VALUE FOR`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8726-L8732), and no [`LEFT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8265) and [`RIGHT`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8284), which the ShardingSphere lexer reads as [keywords](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/Keyword.g4#L198-L204);
- [`positionFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L325-L327) accepts only `POSITION(a IN b)`, not the form with a comma ([`POSITION`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L8376-L8377));
- [`aggregationFunctionName`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L298-L300) has no [`LIST`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7996-L7999), and [`aggregationFunction`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L294-L296) has no [`FILTER`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7946) clause;
- [`predicate`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L246-L255) has no [`CONTAINING`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7111-L7113), and [`simpleExpr`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/8a10a2f4822841b45561796ad02c4709ae69e2e2/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/BaseRule.g4#L273-L288) has no [`SINGULAR`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/dsql/parse.y#L7171-L7174).

