### Before reporting a bug

- [x] I have searched open and closed [GitHub issues](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/issues).
- [x] I have read the [ShardingSphere documentation](https://shardingsphere.apache.org/document/current/en/overview).

### ShardingSphere version

master, commit [`01446d4fad4`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/commit/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df)

### ShardingSphere project

ShardingSphere-Proxy

### Expected behavior

The proxy should apply the transaction parameters [`isc_tpb_nowait`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3111-L3135) and [`isc_tpb_lock_timeout`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3320-L3383) of [`op_transaction`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/remote/server/server.cpp#L5147-L5148) as the Firebird server does, so that an update of a locked row fails at once or after the lock timeout.

### Actual behavior

The proxy does not apply these parameters, and an update of a locked row waits until the lock is released.

The same steps were executed directly on the Firebird server and through the proxy, and the rows were read directly from the server:

| Steps | Firebird server | Proxy |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Another transaction, directly on the Firebird server, updates the row with ID = 8953 and does not commit. A transaction with [`isc_tpb_nowait`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3111-L3135) updates the same row | Error [`isc_lock_conflict`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/lock/lock.cpp#L552-L553) "lock conflict on no wait transaction; update conflicts with concurrent update" | No answer within 5 seconds. After the other transaction rolls back, success |
| The same with [`isc_tpb_wait`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3018-L3033) and [`isc_tpb_lock_timeout`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3320-L3383) 1 instead of [`isc_tpb_nowait`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/jrd/tra.cpp#L3111-L3135) | Error [`isc_lock_timeout`](https://github.com/FirebirdSQL/firebird/blob/v5.0.4/src/lock/lock.cpp#L552-L553) "lock time-out on wait transaction; update conflicts with concurrent update" | No answer within 5 seconds. After the other transaction rolls back, success |

So through the proxy the updates of a locked row hang until the lock is released, while the Firebird server answers them with an error.

### Reason analysis

- [`FirebirdStartTransactionPacket`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/packet/command/query/transaction/FirebirdStartTransactionPacket.java#L31) reads from the TPB only [`isAutoCommit`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/packet/command/query/transaction/FirebirdStartTransactionPacket.java#L48-L50), [`isReadOnly`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/packet/command/query/transaction/FirebirdStartTransactionPacket.java#L57-L59) and [`getIsolationLevel`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/packet/command/query/transaction/FirebirdStartTransactionPacket.java#L66-L77). The items [`WAIT`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/constant/buffer/type/FirebirdTransactionParameterBufferType.java#L42), [`NOWAIT`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/constant/buffer/type/FirebirdTransactionParameterBufferType.java#L43) and [`LOCK_TIMEOUT`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/database/protocol/dialect/firebird/src/main/java/org/apache/shardingsphere/database/protocol/firebird/constant/buffer/type/FirebirdTransactionParameterBufferT