### Reason analysis

- The rules [`firstValue`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/DMLStatement.g4#L92-L94) and [`skipValue`](https://github.com/apache/shardingsphere/blob/01446d4fad48450e7fc3eb3b3631b25d6bf411df/parser/sql/engine/dialect/firebird/src/main/antlr4/imports/firebird/DMLStatement.g4#L96-L98) of the Firebird grammar of ShardingSphere accept only a number or a parameter marker, optionally in parentheses, not an expression, so the proxy rejects these statements with a syntax error.
